WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:16.680
<v Aeolus>Take this bag of oxhide, Odysseus — every rough wind is bound inside, sewn shut with silver wire. I loose the West Wind only; let it carry you home to Ithaca.

2
00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:31.330
<v Aeolus>Out of my island — out, worst of living men! You come back cursed; the blessed gods themselves hate you. I give no help to what heaven hunts.
